  "definition": "Compliance Standards for Touch-Up and Repair Activities at Wood Furniture, Wood Burial Casket, and Gunstock Coating Facilities",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-10-17",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
